title    Magma Core
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Inferno option "magma": boss-rush electro in G minor at 160. A sawtooth lead with glides carries the hook over a sixteenth-note FM bass and 3+3+2 choir stabs, with orchestra hits and a clap on a four-on-the-floor bigkick. The last eight bars lift a tone. Layers: FM bass and choir stabs, then the kit and orchestra hits at 2x, the saw lead at 3x, distorted power-chord stabs and an open hat at FRENZY.
tempo    160
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.24

# untagged voices are the base layer; the intro plays every layer
voice bass   fmbass     vol=0.5  gate=0.55
voice stab   voices     vol=0.42 pan=-0.25 center=D4 gate=0.45
voice kick   bigkick    vol=0.55 layer=drums
voice clap   clap909    vol=0.45 pan=0.05 layer=drums
voice hat    hat909     vol=0.28 pan=0.3 layer=drums
voice crash  crash      vol=0.3  pan=-0.2 layer=drums
voice hit    orchhit    vol=0.42 layer=drums
voice rise   riser      vol=0.26 layer=drums
voice lead   saw        vol=0.5  glide=0.06 layer=lead
voice dist   distguitar vol=0.3  pan=0.4 gate=0.45 layer=frenzy
voice ohat   ohat909    vol=0.22 pan=-0.4 layer=frenzy

pattern intro
hit   | [Gm]!--- .--- [Gm]!--- .--- | [Eb]!--- [D]!--- [D]!------- |
rise  | _ | G5--------------- |
bass  | G2 G2 G3 G2 G2 G2 G3 G2 G2 G2 G3 G2 G2 G2 G3 G2 | D2 D2 D3 D2 D2 D2 D3 D2 D2 D2 D3 D2 D2 D2 D3 D2 |
kick  | x... .... x... .... | x... x... x... x.x. |

pattern A
lead  | G5--- D5- G5- Bb5--- A5- G5- | G5--- Eb5- G5- Bb5- C6- Bb5- G5- | C6--- G5- Eb5- C5--- D5- Eb5- | D5------- F#5--- A5--- |
bass  | G2 G2 G3 G2 G2 G2 G3 G2 G2 G2 G3 G2 G2 G2 G3 G2 | Eb2 Eb2 Eb3 Eb2 Eb2 Eb2 Eb3 Eb2 Eb2 Eb2 Eb3 Eb2 Eb2 Eb2 Eb3 Eb2 | C3 C3 C4 C3 C3 C3 C4 C3 C3 C3 C4 C3 C3 C3 C4 C3 | D2 D2 D3 D2 D2 D2 D3 D2 D2 D2 D3 D2 D2 D2 D3 D2 |
stab  | [Gm]- .- .- [Gm]- .- .- [Gm]- .- | [Eb]- .- .- [Eb]- .- .- [Eb]- .- | [Cm]- .- .- [Cm]- .- .- [Cm]- .- | [D]- .- .- [D]- .- .- [D7]- .- |
kick  | x... x... x... x... | % | % | % |
clap  | .... x... .... x... | % | % | .... x... .... x.xx |
hat   | ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x. | % | % | % |
crash | X... .... .... .... | _ | _ | _ |
hit   | [Gm]!--- .----------- | _ | [Cm]!--- .----------- | _ |
dist  | G2+D3- .- .- G2+D3- .- .- G2+D3- .- | Eb3+Bb3- .- .- Eb3+Bb3- .- .- Eb3+Bb3- .- | C3+G3- .- .- C3+G3- .- .- C3+G3- .- | D3+A3- .- .- D3+A3- .- .- D3+A3- .- |
ohat  | ..x. ..x. ..x. ..x. | % | % | % |

pattern A2 from A
lead  | G5--- D5- G5- Bb5--- A5- G5- | G5--- Eb5- G5- Bb5- C6- Bb5- G5- | C6--- G5- Eb5- C5--- D5- Eb5- | D6------- C6- A5- F#5- D5- |
crash | _ | _ | _ | _ |

pattern B from A
lead  | Bb5------- G5------- | C6------- A5--- F5--- | D6--- Bb5--- G5--- Bb5--- | A5------- F#5- D5- C5- A4- |
bass  | Eb2 Eb2 Eb3 Eb2 Eb2 Eb2 Eb3 Eb2 Eb2 Eb2 Eb3 Eb2 Eb2 Eb2 Eb3 Eb2 | F2 F2 F3 F2 F2 F2 F3 F2 F2 F2 F3 F2 F2 F2 F3 F2 | G2 G2 G3 G2 G2 G2 G3 G2 G2 G2 G3 G2 G2 G2 G3 G2 | D2 D2 D3 D2 D2 D2 D3 D2 D2 D2 D3 D2 D2 D2 D3 D2 |
stab  | [Eb]- .- .- [Eb]- .- .- [Eb]- .- | [F]- .- .- [F]- .- .- [F]- .- | [Gm]- .- .- [Gm]- .- .- [Gm]- .- | [D7]- .- .- [D7]- .- .- [D7]- .- |
dist  | Eb3+Bb3- .- .- Eb3+Bb3- .- .- Eb3+Bb3- .- | F2+C3- .- .- F2+C3- .- .- F2+C3- .- | G2+D3- .- .- G2+D3- .- .- G2+D3- .- | D3+A3- .- .- D3+A3- .- .- D3+A3- .- |
hit   | [Eb]!--- .----------- | _ | [Gm]!--- .----------- | _ |
crash | X... .... .... .... | _ | _ | _ |

pattern B2 from B
lead  | Bb5------- G5------- | C6------- A5--- F5--- | D6--- Bb5--- G5--- Bb5--- | D6------- ~A5--- ~D5--- |
rise  | _ | _ | _ | G5--------------- |
clap  | .... x... .... x... | % | % | x.x. x.x. xxxx XXXX |

play intro
loop A A2 B B2 A A2 A+2 A2+2
